    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d250-a1">

                <pb facs="0442" n="408" sameAs="frus:frus1870/pg408"/>

                <head>Sir John Young to Mr.
                        Thornton.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ottawa, Canada,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1870-04-11"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 11, 1870.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> With reference to your dispatch of April 2,
                    I have the honor to transmit to you herewith a memorandum from prime minister of
                    the Dominion, together with copies of the fishery acts, (1868,) in order to
                    supply the Secretary of State of the United States with the information he
                    requires.</p>



